---
title: "setLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_validate: caller is owner/admin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_validate --> q_set: address != address(0)
    q_validate --> q_revert_zero: zero address
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert ZeroAddress
    q_set --> [*]: registry[id] = address, emit AddressSet

    note right of q_set
        INV-001: centralized registry for all Legion infrastructure addresses
        INV-002: address changes propagate to sales via syncLegionAddresses
    end note
